  "approval": "NOT APPROVED. This file is an agent proposal for the owner. Bindings take effect only when the owner copies approved entries into curation/verification-plan.json testBindings and the plan is recompiled (RDP-003). Nothing reads this file as approved.",
  "description": "Proposed producer bindings for the process-record and owner-decision categories of the v2 plan, and for independent-acceptance where a Praxis independent-review record is the producer. Each binding names one Praxis record kind (praxis:<kind>) that requirements-compiler verify-process can check for a candidate. A process record proves that the step was recorded as it happened; where the obligation also requires independent-acceptance, a reviewer still judges its adequacy, so no binding here proves an obligation alone. Where several producers are bound to one category, every one of them must deliver a qualifying record.",
